WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.590
Getting funded with Lamp. Part two: your account.

2
00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.980
Your account shows where your file stands.

3
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:16.190
The checklist goes: answers received, documents uploaded, shopping your file, offers ready, and funded.

4
00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:20.820
What we need lists the four things every funder asks for.

5
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.550
Your last three business bank statements, one file per month.

6
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:31.330
A voided business check or a bank letter. A photo of your driver's license. And the signed funder application.

7
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:38.870
Pick what the file is, then tap to choose files. A PDF or a photo works, up to twenty megabytes each.

8
00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:42.100
Your files are private to you and the Lamp team.

9
00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:49.080
Funders need the full application before they can make an offer. Complete and sign it here, in about ten minutes.

10
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:55.650
Your rep may also text you a link to send a document. Tap it, and drop the files in. No sign-in.

11
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.490
Next: your offers.
